 "html": "<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1722906561666\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/2a27745b529548b78cc13148d3d198a9_1722906561666_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\">Greetings, Agents. </span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\">This is CM Fragment of MARVEL Future Fight.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">In this patch, meet a deadly martial artist and a leader of space pirates.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">Psylocke</span>, who uses powerful psychic abilities including blades created by telekinesis, </span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">has received a new Uniform and Tier-4.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">Yondu</span>, who freely controls the Yaka Arrow, has also received a new Uniform and Tier-3.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">Agents, check out the new skills and power of the updated heroes</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">by downloading the 8/6 Patch!</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><b><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#740060\">■ 8/6 Patch Details</span></span></b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">Patch Schedule: 8/7 (Wed) 3:00 (UTC+0), 8/6 (Tue) 20:00 (PDT)</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">[8/7 (Wed) 2:50&nbsp;(UTC+0), 8/6&nbsp;(Tue) 19:50&nbsp;(PDT) added]</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">The patch has been completed as of&nbsp;<br>\n8/7 (Wed) 2:50&nbsp;(UTC+0), 8/6 (Tue) 19:50&nbsp;(PDT).<br>\nPlease reconnect to the game and download the patch file.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The patch completion time may be changed depending on the circumstances </span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">and the </span><span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">completion time will be announced once the patch has been completed.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The patch will be applied in waves, so the application time may vary by Agent.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The game can still be accessed during the patch.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">When the patch is complete, please restart and apply the patch for better service.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><b><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22\">▣ Two New Uniforms</span></span></b></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">Two new Uniforms, Psylocke &lt;Summer Vacation&gt; </span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">and Yondu &lt;Summer Vacation&gt; have been added.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The two new Uniforms can be purchased after the 8/6 Patch data has been applied.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ef007c\">* The new Uniforms, Psylocke &lt;Summer Vacation&gt; and Yondu &lt;Summer Vacation&gt;</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ef007c\">can be purchased during the event period.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">▶ Psylocke &lt;Summer Vacation&gt;</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">After the 8/6 Patch - 8/23 (Fri) 14:59 (UTC+0),</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">After the 8/6 Patch - 8/23 (Fri) 7:59 (PDT)</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9\">- Purchase method: Can be exchanged at the Event Token Shop with Fun Summer Tokens</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><spa